// === Test Case: Azure VM Run Command Abuse ===
// Simulates: one principal issuing Run Command to 4 VMs (malicious fleet RCE) +
// a single legitimate Run Command for troubleshooting (benign / medium).
// Expected: 1 high alert (VMCount >= 3).
// Query expects: AzureActivity

